WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.740
The trolls are crumbling...

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.080
What is this light?

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.320
His wound's healing!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.270
<i>This is...</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:17.740
<i>her magic?</i>

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.990
Somehow, I made it in time.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.870
What's going on? You did this?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.690
I told you...

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.380
To protect the church, I erected 
a shield with magic.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.200
This shield will stand as long as it 
exists within my consciousness,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.440
and will destroy any spirit that tries 
to do us harm within the circle.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.300
Magic?

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.760
Impossible.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:44.310
I will not accept this black magic.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.330
The four colored lights 
are the manifestation

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.640
of the power of the great beings

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.400
in the spiritual realm that 
are protecting us.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:01:00.370
Those great beings are the four 
guardian angels recorded

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.800
in your Holy See's scripture.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.410
No matter how it's expressed,

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.240
the sun is the sun, and light is light.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.730
No matter how different our scriptures,

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.070
our cries for aid are the 
same, aren't they?

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:19.670
Separating and condemning people 
over such a difference is foolish.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.090
The name of God is God's alone.

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.040
It is not for humans to decide.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.050
But how?

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:29.320
Our scriptures have nothing so powerful.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.320
They cannot call forth miracles, 
like your spells.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:37.460
The church is a shrine where people
commune with angels and spirits.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:41.450
Mages have a shrine within their hearts.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:43.590
Within their hearts?

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.700
That isn't possible.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:50.340
It isn't a belief in something 
that you cannot see.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:52.280
If you have no doubt,

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.680
you can see it, feel it, and touch it.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:58.430
Well, aren't you an impressive girl...

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:05.140
<b><i>The Arcana of Invocation</i></b>

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.970
What's that?

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.410
A monster?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.550
What is that monster?

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:46.410
<i>An ogre!</i>

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:49.260
Og...

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:49.910
...re!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.770
An ogre.

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.510
<i>Why is something like that in this world?</i>

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.430
Holy crap...

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:12.660
It's all right. An ogre cannot 
set foot within this shield.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.560
However...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.560
No!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.330
What's going on?

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:25.610
<i>This shield protects against spiritual 
forms, not physical ones.</i>

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.300
What?

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:48.650
We're finished!

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.390
With a monster like that...

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.580
<i>We need to buy time...</i>

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.560
<i>Time for me to cast a spell.</i>

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.240
Hey...

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.570
Got it, Commander.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.820
Hey, hey! What the heck is he thinking?

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.830
That's impossible! He'll be flattened!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.270
Nah.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.580
He's pretty used to this kind of stuff.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.210
<i>No!</i>

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.150
See? I told you.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.230
I don't believe it.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.030
Who the heck is that guy?

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.940
<i>He really is amazing.</i>

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.480
See? I told you!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.970
I knew he wasn't normal, but to 
think it was to this extent...

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.420
Well, would you look at that...

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.640
Now's your chance!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:54.120
<i>He managed that much, using only 
his physical body without magic.</i>

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.170
<i>How can a mortal go that far?</i>

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.520
I guess you're as tough as you are big.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.060
Not like the small fry.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:10.090
Before its arm attaches...

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:16.850
<i>Water?</i>

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.420
That's a kelpie!

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.070
Kelpie, as in the things that 
drown travelers in rivers?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.070
First an ogre, now a kelpie. But why?

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.120
Rain... No!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.690
What the hell?

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:37.200
That monster can use magic?

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.870
<i>A kelpie is a mid-level water spirit.</i>

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.270
<i>It easily controls elementals</i>

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.800
<i>of the same type that are a lower 
level or without consciousness!</i>

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.540
<i>A kelpie in the rain is 
highly dangerous.</i>

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.390
Come on... It just goes after anything?

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.180
<i>They're following their desires.</i>

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.270
<i>They want to devour the spirits of 
humans, which they rarely get.</i>

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.070
<i>This isn't good!</i>

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:06.820
<i>An ogre and a kelpie, on top of the 
trolls. It's completely unexpected!</i>

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:07.950
I'll go.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:08.850
Serpico!

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:11.530
It's impossible! Dealing with 
trolls is one thing, but...

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.620
It's all right.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.910
I shall deal with them and 
buy you some time.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.650
So, if you could cast the spell...

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:18.330
But...

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:19.890
Lady Farnese...

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:20.830
Eh?

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:24.170
Please make sure to protect Casca.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.990
Huh? Right...

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:30.050
Now, then...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.370
Serpico!

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.640
He flew.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:44.400
<i>To think he was able to control the 
sylphs to this extent so quickly...</i>

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:49.780
<i>Lady Farnese, I was unable to free you.</i>

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.420
<i>Only stayed by your side.</i>

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:56.380
<i>No, I never even considered doing so.</i>

00:07:56.380 --> 00:08:01.190
<i>I was surrounded by a dark repose 
beside another closed soul...</i>

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:03.840
<i>Like the other half of myself.</i>

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.420
<i>But that appears to be at an end.</i>

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:10.370
Be careful. They aren't 
like the usual ones.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:10.370
<i>But I'll at least ensure</i>

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.690
Good grief. I don't know what 
you consider usual ones.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:15.250
<i>my other half isn't torn to 
shreds within the storm.</i>

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:19.430
Spirits of the wind, give me strength.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.830
An anything-goes tag match.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:23.720
Now, then...

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.900
It appears the frog horse 
is better suited to me.

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.430
I'll take care of it.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:40.620
Do what you want.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.950
This thing is simpler and 
better for me to fight.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.880
Whoa... He defeated it.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.270
He defeated that monster by himself.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.600
Of course.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.490
And you've become the small fry.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.030
You're an excellent small fry, though.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.030
<i>I can't do a single thing, 
at a time like this?</i>

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:23.160
What is this sight? Oh, God!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.200
I must hurry.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:31.210
Deeper... Slightly beyond the 
spirit world's depths!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.920
That's a shrine...

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:41.630
The spiritual form of the shrine that 
stood before the church was built.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.680
Water elementals... Undines!

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:48.440
I see!

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.350
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:08.150
<i>A wall of water is blocking 
all of my attacks.</i>

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:12.360
<i>On the other hand, I am unable 
to block everything.</i>

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:15.890
<i>To think a splash of water 
was so powerful...</i>

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.960
<i>I'm being pushed back...</i>

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:21.590
<i>Though, since I'm a beginner to 
magic, that can't be helped.</i>

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.300
<i>This is...</i>

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.110
<i>I can't breathe!</i>

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:34.610
Something is wrong 
with Serpico! Serpico!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.310
<i>I see...</i>

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.680
Splashing water at me wasn't 
the extent of its abilities.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:58.090
I was about to drown atop this hill.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.850
But because of that, now I know

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:06.790
the wind doesn't only have the 
power to cut through things.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.690
I'm counting on you, little spirits.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:21.110
If we cannot cut through it, 
we just need to lift it up.

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:31.000
Serpico!

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.260
<i>I lowered my guard...</i>

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.010
This isn't good! Serpico's in trouble!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:53.880
Serpico!

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.270
You fool! You'll fall!

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:03.820
The water is moving away 
from the kelpie?

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.080
What the...

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.720
Is this witchcraft, as well?

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:19.710
That's...

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.220
What? What do you see?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.340
That's a water spirit.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.780
Right now, Schierke is one 
with the water spirit.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.600
It's what you call possession.

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.770
An angel?

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.260
I am the kindred of water.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:41.520
I am the spirit that flows in 
the rivers of this land.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.850
In accordance with the ancient covenant,

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:47.010
I purify the evil spirits that 
have soiled this land.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:52.080
On behalf of the Lady of the 
Depths, I order the undines.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.910
Wash into the underworld's dark depths

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:58.210
the evil spirits that plague the land.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:02.700
Water...

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:04.680
I am water.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:07.210
I am water itself.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:11.020
Gather, my kindred.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:16.310
Gather, gather, surge, and flow.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:18.810
Rumbling?

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.570
Now what?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.690
This doesn't seem good.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.560
The river's flooding! 
It's headed this way!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.710
<i>This is magic?</i>

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:03.860
Come inside, kid! 
You'll get swallowed up.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.700
Dropey?

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.420
That's insane.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:22.670
The trolls... All the monsters 
were washed away.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.950
We're saved!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.950
We're somehow alive!

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.440
Lady Witch! Lady Witch!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.300
Witch...

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.040
We did it, Dropey!

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.680
Dropey?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.030
That's enough, Schierke.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.960
Looks like you defeated them all.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:49.900
Schierke, we should wrap things up.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.280
What's the matter?

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.340
This isn't good.

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:56.940
The connection to the water spirit's 
too strong. She's forgotten herself.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.040
At this rate...

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.930
The spell won't break?

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:04.990
No... Schierke—

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:09.380
No, no! If you pull her out during a spell, 
who knows what will happen?

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.390
Right now, Schierke's 
in the spirit realm.

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:17.760
She probably melted into this flow when 
she became one with the water spirit.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:20.080
If we wake her body 
before her soul is back,

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.400
who knows what the effects may be?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.400
Her soul might not be able to return, 
rendering her an invalid.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.360
Then what should we do?

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.320
Um, uh... I think for 
something like this...

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.380
Right, that's it! You use this 
wand and tap it in rhythm.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.210
By tapping it in a constant rhythm,

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.470
the caster's consciousness will 
concentrate on this world.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.660
Or that's what Flora said.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:43.420
The rhythm is seven-seven-seven. 
Seven, three times.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:48.090
Flow... Intensely. Surge.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:51.900
Anger that cannot be expressed 
using human words!

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.260
This is...

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.740
Becoming one with the 
spirits is very important.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.390
But you mustn't let them swallow you.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.000
In order to stop that,

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:07.460
the mage must tap their wand 
to retain their consciousness.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:09.550
Do not forget.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:14.030
The way of magic is never about 
becoming one with power.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.550
The way of magic...

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.060
<i>That's right. I...</i>

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.170
Schierke!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:25.520
Schierke?

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.170
Hey! What the heck's going on?

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.350
Grab on!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.830
What are you doing? 
Wake up, witch!

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.830
Stop!

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:49.480
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.200
Grab on!

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:56.200
Casca!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.450
Lady Farnese!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.970
It's all over.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.460
Well?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.310
No good!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.750
I can't find them anywhere.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:31.230
Lady Farnese... Have those 
two not been found?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.380
You aren't supposed to move yet!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.740
It's all right.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.460
Currently, Schierke is tracing their od.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.580
<i>This is all my fault.</i>

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.080
<i>I drowned in the power...</i>

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.380
<i>If I had only acted more properly...</i>

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:46.730
Hey.

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:50.360
Let the tension out of your shoulders.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:54.470
If you're that stiff, you won't be able 
to do things you normally can.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:57.970
You did a great job. 
Honestly, I'm surprised.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:02.750
You saved this village... 
Though you were a bit rough.

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.570
No one blames you.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:09.230
And so, I'm counting on you, Lady Witch.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.800
I found them! I can sense them!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:20.160
Their od... They're both fine!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.410
Really?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.810
But this is...

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:23.790
What's wrong?

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:31.390
Thank you.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.450
Thank you, Lady Witch.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.650
Hey, what do you need to be able 
to do something so amazing?

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:39.400
You should be thankful.

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:42.260
Um, well, I borrowed the power 
of an angel or spirit.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:46.540
The ones who protected you are the four 
great angels from your scripture,

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.400
who protect the four cardinal points.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:52.620
And the Lady of the Depths,

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:57.150
the river spirit who was worshiped 
here before this church was built.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:02.960
Come to think of it, I think my great 
grandfather mentioned that.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.680
Long ago, a shrine was 
on this hill, where the

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.840
river goddess was worshiped.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.530
The river spirit was a bit unruly

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:16.280
at being awakened after having 
been forgotten for so long.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:19.220
That's why the village was flooded...

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.640
It's because I'm still inexperienced.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.510
Don't worry about it.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.510
We can rebuild our houses again.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:29.360
We're alive right now because of you.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.540
<i>That isn't the only thing.</i>

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:36.910
<i>My rage against the villagers 
also caused this to happen.</i>

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:41.440
Reverend, would it be possible 
to build a small shrine

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:45.310
for the river spirit, in the 
west of this square?

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:49.410
Very well. Tolerance is 
another of God's teachings.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.630
But I'm so surprised!

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:55.390
To think a little girl like you could 
cause a miracle like that!

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:57.960
Can anyone use magic?

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.540
You need many years of 
training to learn magic,

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.780
but if you desire the angels or 
spirits to hear your wishes,

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:07.060
you all can do something.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.970
The reverend is very 
familiar with the method.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.040
What's the matter, boy?

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.200
Leave me alone.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:22.030
Are you okay, Gramps?
Walking around like that...

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:26.500
Yes, I feel much better, 
thanks to that little girl.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.540
I wanted to at least thank you.

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:32.840
The hero who saved this village 
doesn't need to thank me.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:36.620
Oh, stop it. I didn't do anything.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.140
I couldn't do a thing.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.950
I'm just a brat that was 
running around, flailing.

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.600
Oh, that's right.

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:46.250
There's something I wanted to give you.

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:48.490
What's this?

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:52.970
Long ago, my old man won 
that in a bet with a sailor.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:57.310
It should be small enough 
that you can use it.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:58.940
Are you sure?

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:01.160
A parting gift from an old man.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.570
I just remembered.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.660
I ran away...

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:09.960
From the village, my family 
business, my sick mother...

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:13.580
From all of those heavy, 
complicated things.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:16.660
Dreams are strange things.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:22.530
They can seem like brave challenges 
or like cowardly running away.

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:27.030
I wonder which your dream will be.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.010
This is the problem with old people.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.610
Listen up, Gramps!

00:21:31.610 --> 00:21:36.580
My ambition isn't some half-assed, 
fluffy kind of bullshit.

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:40.980
I'll show you that mine 
is the real deal!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:44.220
And so, I'll gratefully take this.

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.650
Well?

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.410
He won't die, but...

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.770
He won't be able to move immediately.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:54.750
My spell on the church hasn't 
completely worn off.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.540
With another night, I'm sure 
the wounds will heal.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:59.960
But I don't know if we have time...

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:03.060
Please go at once.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:08.220
And please take care of Lady Farnese.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:11.070
I'm heading out.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:17.220
Hey.

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:21.260
Quit standing around. 
I'm gonna leave you behind.

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.460
<b>Rot.</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>This is Qliphoth, the territory 
of darkness, in the astral realm.</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>You're a man. Protect the women.</b>

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>Your soul is suited to Qliphoth.</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>When you gaze into the darkness, 
the darkness gazes into you, as well.</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:27.020
<b><i>Next Episode 
The Corruption of Qliphoth</i></b>
